  <EnglishText>
    <Row Tag="LOC_RP_MOD_NAME"><Text>Better Resource UI</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_RP_MOD_DESCRIPTION"><Text>Resource sorting, quick and bulk actions, controller navigation, settlement preferences and automatic allocation.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_RP_AUTO_ASSIGN"><Text>Assign by preference</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_RP_AUTO_TIP"><Text>Compare weighted gains across all eligible settlements: Food ×2, Production/Science/Culture ×4, Gold ×1, Happiness ×8 up to zero. Preferred yields double their score; avoided yields score zero. Unmarked yields keep their base weight. When current progress is known, all production gains use the same rule: production usable by the current item plus base production above its remaining requirement. Gains that only fill the percentage-bonus waste gap score zero; additional base overflow still counts. Missing progress uses the original estimate.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_RP_INCLUDE_CAMELS"><Text>Include Camels</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_RP_CAMELS_TIP"><Text>Allow Camels to expand resource capacity. Also enable Include assigned resources to consider moving Camels that are already assigned.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_RP_INCLUDE_ASSIGNED"><Text>Include assigned resources</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_RP_ASSIGNED_TIP"><Text>Allow existing assignments to be rearranged. When off, use only unassigned resources.</Text></Row>
