    <Row Tag="LOC_RP_PREFERENCE_HELP"><Text>Bare-yield leaders are preferred by default. Any manual edit stops automatic updates; reset restores defaults.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_RP_RESET_DEFAULTS"><Text>Reset preferences</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_RP_RESET_DEFAULTS_TIP"><Text>Replace current preference and avoidance marks with defaults based on the highest positive bare yield of each type. Ties share the preference. Excludes resource additions and percentage bonuses. Re-enables updates on opening or auto-assignment until the next manual edit. Does not assign resources.</Text></Row>
